  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 887bfd84842dd0d4584556120a106f9f, type: 3}
  m_Name: Act1Story
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ActStoryData
  storyParts:
  - video: {fileID: 32900000, guid: bd8772ab08391d948955e336a8fb27e7, type: 3}
    backgroundMusic: {fileID: 8300000, guid: c301256a98e7d4927b11ad389f99beae, type: 3}
    storyText: In a world ruled by ancient forests and magical crystals, Strawberry
      and Steel lived together in peace. Inseparable companions, they had shared
      countless adventures. But neither of them knew that darkness was approaching.
  - video: {fileID: 32900000, guid: 480e91de23c80044f828c3bd6821e123, type: 3}
    backgroundMusic: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 17cd76dba35fcd04fbd3813b94fa5428, type: 3}
    storyText: One day, creatures of the Dark Element attacked the forest. Strawberry
      and Steel fought back, but their enemies were too powerful. Dark chains wrapped
      around Steel and dragged him into an unknown realm. Strawberry reached out
      to save him, but it was too late.
  - video: {fileID: 32900000, guid: 980cc1aacb52b0d4fbfa2b6461a04403, type: 3}
    backgroundMusic: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 4c4fea01bfb4b4aed9cacc0dfdb6ee37, type: 3}
    storyText: 'Left alone in the silence, Strawberry felt an overwhelming pain after
      losing his closest companion. That pain slowly turned into anger, awakening
      a power he never knew existed. His body transformed, merging the powers of
      Strawberry and Steel into a new form. Now, he had only one purpose: to find
      Steel and put an end to the darkness.'
